[0.013782, "o", "\r\n== before: email_focus_worker built from main e22fa6483f5 (before this branch); the other services from this branch\r\n== scenario: gmail_a_linked_inbox_follows_the_flag_of_the_user_who_linked_it\r\n   Ada has the Focus flag and links the mailbox of Bob, who has a Macro account and no flag.\r\n   Carol and Dan have no flag; Carol links Dan's mailbox. Dan's mail arrives first,\r\n   Bob's once the worker has passed over Dan's. The test waits up to 120 s for Bob's verdict.\r\n\r\n"]
